@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5021

GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Log in (Development seeds admin@example.com); copy accessToken into the variable below
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "username": "", "password": "AdminPassword123!" }

@token = paste-accessToken-here
@refreshToken = paste-refreshToken-here

### Refresh: no access token needed; refresh tokens are single use, so paste the new pair from each response
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Last 78 four-hour BTCUSDT futures candles (Ichimoku lookback)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/candles/binance/futures/btcusdt/4h/latest?limit=78
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Dashboard cards: one per symbol with price, 24 h change, sparkline and data lag
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/dashboard/series?market=futures
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### One card in a chosen time frame, with funding rate / open interest / liquidations
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/dashboard/series/binance/futures/btcusdt?timeframe=4h
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### A page of 15m candles; follow nextFrom for the next one
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/candles/binance/futures/btcusdt/15m?from=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
